  "description": "Furiously fast, powerfully capable\nPowerful, agile and balanced, Karve RS is a thrilling all-rounder that pairs proportional geometry with size-specific tuning to deliver balanced, assured handling for every rider. Confident and highly capable, it’s built for those who expect more control, composure and consistency from every ride. From steep descents to technical climbs and demanding back-country trails, it delivers the stability and precision to stay on line when it matters. Controlled handling, strong, responsive support and a planted feel let you ride with commitment and carry speed with confidence. Designed, developed and proven in the UK, Karve RS is built to be dependable, resilient and ready to perform all year-round. All so you can turn every ride up to 11 – and keep it there.\n\nHighlights\n– 160mm front + 160mm rear of proven Quad-Link 4 suspension, with carefully custom-tuned rear shocks.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre (front) and alloy (rear) frame with geometry adjustment is light and strong.\n– Avinox M2S full-torque (up to 150Nm), full-power (1300W peak) motor with five assistance modes (auto, eco, trail, turbo + boost)\n– SRAM Eagle 70 mechanical T-Type 1x12 transmission + SRAM Maven Base four-piston hydraulic brakes.\n– Avinox DPC100 OLED top-tube touchscreen display delivers a wealth of customisable information at your fingertips.\n– 800Wh internal battery so you can ride further.\n– 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear + MX ready.\n\nIdeal for... Enthusiast riders who want a light, mid-travel full-power enduro-capable eMTB that delivers the very best handling and performance possible for maximum thrills – everywhere.\n\nCharge time (800Wh): 80% in 4hr 54mins approx. from empty, and to 100% in 6hrs 11mins approx. with 4A charger.\n\nDiscover Karve >",
